(termFormat EnglishWrittenLanguage SANodalArtery "s a nodal artery")
(documentation SANodalArtery EnglishWrittenLanguage "s a nodal artery")
 ;(in 60%)
(connectedBodyPartTypes RightCoronaryArtery SANodalArtery Human)

