(termFormat EnglishWrittenLanguage RightMarginalArtery "right marginal artery")
(documentation RightMarginalArtery EnglishWrittenLanguage "right marginal artery")

(connectedBodyPartTypes RightCoronaryArtery RightMarginalArtery Human)
